<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/18/eng@/~cl_8__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The repeal of the Social and Welfare Services Lotteries Board Act 1950-1962 shall not affect any person' s liability to be prosecuted or punished for offences committed under the repealed Act before the appointed date, or any proceedings brought or sentence imposed before that date in respect of such offence."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/18/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/18/eng@/~cl_8__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/18/eng@/~cl_8> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/18/eng@> .
