<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/18/eng@/~cl_8__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any appeal brought, or any leave to appeal applied for, on or after the appointed date, against a decision given SOCIAL AND WELFARE SERVICES LOTTERIES BOARD (DISSOLUTION) before the appointed date in any legal proceedings to which the Board was a party thereto may be brought by or against the Government as it might have been by or against the Board as if this Act had not been passed."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1991/18/eng@> .
